            From Prediction to Trusted Data to Governed Action
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="layer-card">
              <div class="layer-img">
                <img src="/assets/screen-chart.png" alt="Pricing Insight Engine">
              </div>

              <span>Layer 1</span>
              <h3>Pricing Insight Engine</h3>
              <p>
                Forecasts commodity prices using market, weather, geopolitical,
                and operational signals.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="layer-card">
              <div class="layer-img">
                <img src="/assets/screen-op.png" alt="Data Core Platform">
              </div>

              <span>Layer 2</span>
              <h3>Data Core Platform</h3>
              <p>
                Unifies internal and external data into a single trusted source
                for decision-making.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="layer-card">
              <div class="layer-img">
                <img src="/assets/screen-rec.png" alt="Agentic AI Recommendation Layer">
              </div>

              <span>Layer 3</span>
              <h3>Agentic AI Recommendation Layer</h3>
              <p>
                Generates explainable recommendations and governed workflows
                tailored to trading operations.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


